{"4443390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Clank-Robotics", "steam_appid": 4443390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4787710], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build | Program | Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and program your very own autonomous battle bot to dominate the arena. Learn the fundamentals of programming and robotics in a fun, engaging and competative environment. You will need to outsmart other people's robots to keep your machine competative in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your own robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own robots in the robot editor. Design your robot the way you want. Place every sensor, weapon, and wheel yourself, and tie it all together in the logic editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443390/extras/caf184dc7a1019e2310ffaabb6ef8b68.poster.avif?t=1782226831\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443390/extras/caf184dc7a1019e2310ffaabb6ef8b68.webm?t=1782226831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443390/extras/caf184dc7a1019e2310ffaabb6ef8b68.mp4?t=1782226831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Program the behaviour of your robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Program your robot’s AI in the Clank-Robotics Visual Scripting editor. You get to program how your robot acts based on the inputs it receives from the sensors you have placed. How smart can you make your robot?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443390/extras/b7229cebf00807d701de51c4171054ea.poster.avif?t=1782226831\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443390/extras/b7229cebf00807d701de51c4171054ea.webm?t=1782226831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443390/extras/b7229cebf00807d701de51c4171054ea.mp4?t=1782226831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight against other people's robots</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against other people's robots in the ranked arena. Climb the leaderboard in Clank-Robotics with your new creation and design the #1 ranked robot in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443390/extras/304522e25be9ab6ceea2a9965b9303a5.poster.avif?t=1782226831\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443390/extras/304522e25be9ab6ceea2a9965b9303a5.webm?t=1782226831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4443390/extras/304522e25be9ab6ceea2a9965b9303a5.mp4?t=1782226831\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build | Program | Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and program your very own autonomous battle bot to dominate the arena. Learn the fundamentals of programming and robotics in a fun, engaging and competative environment. You will need to outsmart other people's robots to keep your machine competative in the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build your own robot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" 